# Model fayllari bayt-aniq bo'lishi shart: `voice/models.json` dagi sha256
# hash'lar LF shaklidagi fayllar uchun hisoblangan. `core.autocrlf=true`
# bo'lgan Windows checkout'da git ularni CRLF ga o'giradi, hash mos kelmaydi
# va `voice_doctor` "MOS EMAS" deb aldanadi (sintez esa ishlayveradi).
*.json      text eol=lf
*.onnx      binary
*.wav       binary
*.png       binary
*.mp4       binary
*.gif       binary
*.ico       binary
